OVERVIEW: Manage Apple Developer Services authentication

USAGE: xtool auth <subcommand>

OPTIONS:
  --version               Show the version.
  -h, --help              Show help information.

SUBCOMMANDS:
  login (default)         Log in to Apple Developer Services
  logout                  Log out of Apple Developer Services
  status                  Get Apple Developer Services auth status

  See 'xtool help auth <subcommand>' for detailed help.
